  "description": "MIRSUF crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: H3 O1 1+,C130 H114 Ho6 N6 O34 P9 1-,2(C3 H7 N1 O1),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho5 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors; Ho6 (Ho) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a chain with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 4.461-4.670 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 134.10-136.30°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [H3O][Ho6(PO4)(AnPO3)8(DMF)6]·2DMF·H2O.",
